<title>ESTONIA: Estonia mo/mo Sept inflation 0.6 pct, yr/yr 20.1.</title>
<headline>Estonia mo/mo Sept inflation 0.6 pct, yr/yr 20.1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian month-on-month inflation was 0.6 percent in September after August's 0.3 percent fall, making for year-on-year inflation of 20.1 percent in September, versus 21.9 percent the previous month, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN CONSUMER PRICES    Sept '96    Aug '96    Sept '95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct) +0.6	  -0.3	 +2.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)   +20.1	 +21.9	+25.9</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
